1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,200
Hi! What can I get for you today?

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:07,400
Can I get a large iced latte with oat milk, please?

3
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,000
Sure. Would you like anything else?

4
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,200
Hmm, maybe a blueberry muffin. Are they fresh?

5
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,400
Baked this morning. They're still a little warm.

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,600
Perfect. I'll take one.

7
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,600
That'll be eight fifty. Can I get a name for the order?

8
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,600
It's Jamie. J-A-M-I-E.

9
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,200
Got it. It'll be ready at the end of the counter.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,400
Large iced latte for... Jenny?

11
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:35,600
Oh, I think that's mine. Did you say Jenny or Jamie?

12
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,800
Sorry, it's a bit loud in here. It says Jenny on the cup.

13
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,000
Hang on, that's my order! Iced latte with oat milk, right?

14
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:44,800
Wait, you ordered the same thing?

15
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:47,600
Looks like it. Great minds think alike.

16
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,200
No worries, I'll make another one right away. Two minutes, tops.

17
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:54,000
Thanks. I'm in no rush.

18
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,200
So, do you come here often? I've never seen you before.

19
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:00,600
I just moved to the neighborhood last week, actually.

20
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,800
Welcome! You picked the best coffee shop on the block.

21
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:06,400
Here you go, Jamie. Sorry for the mix-up!

22
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:09,000
No problem at all. Have a good one!
